flowchart LR
    C[Context]
    I[BackgroundThreadInterface]
    B[BackgroundThreadImpl<br/>dedicated-thread mode]
    E[EventLoop<br/>owns socket and both queues]
    P[AllocatorPool<br/>unique to Context]
    A[Allocator<br/>one per message]
    K[AllocatorKeepAlive<br/>free_buffer(...)]
    M[arrow::MemoryPool]
    T[Thread from ThreadFactory]
    D[Dedicated scheduler]
    W[Future thread-pool scheduler]

    C -->|uses| I
    I -->|delegates to| B
    B -->|owns| E
    B -->|owns| T
    T -->|runs| D
    D -->|accesses directly| E
    W -->|schedules directly| E
    P -->|returns per message| A
    E -->|uses for all message buffers| A
    A -->|implements| K
    A -->|implements| M

    G[Non-RecordBatch buffers call keep-alive free_buffer; RecordBatch may use MemoryPool.]
    P -.-> G
